    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Frequency count</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-palindrome/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 409</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Longest Palindrome</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A palindrome is mirrored pairs plus at most one middle letter. Count the letters, take every pair (c / 2 * 2 per letter), and add 1 if anything was left over. O(n) time, O(1) space (a 128-slot table).</p>\n"
